ool settings</button></div></form><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>School emblem</h3><p>The school emblem appears on reports and certificates and can be shown as a light report watermark.</p></div></div><img class="settings-logo" src="assets/school-logo.jpg" alt="School emblem"></section>
